---
import InfoPage from '../components/InfoPage.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Image Size Reducer" description="Learn about Image Size Reducer, a free browser tool for reducing, resizing, and converting images privately.">
  <InfoPage eyebrow="About the tool" title="Make image limits easier." intro="Image Size Reducer is a fast, free browser tool for reducing, resizing, and converting images without uploading them to a server.">
    <h2>Built for the everyday image problem</h2>
    <p>Images often need to fit a specific file-size or dimension limit before they can be emailed, uploaded, or shared. We built Image Size Reducer to make that task clear: choose a target, add your image, and download a result that fits.</p>
    <h2>Simple by design</h2>
    <p>The tool supports exact size targets, batch processing, JPG, PNG, and WebP conversion, quality controls, and maximum-width resizing. There are no accounts, watermarks, subscriptions, or unnecessary workflows.</p>
    <h2>Privacy first</h2>
    <p>Image processing happens locally in your browser. Your files stay on your device instead of being sent to or stored on our servers.</p>
  </InfoPage>
</Layout>
